would say it's pretty typical.

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:55.660
I've emails from concert venues,
17 magazine, Groupon, but what

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:59.740
really strikes me here is the
number of universities that that

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:02.950
