that year, they emailed me three

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:33.880
separate times to ask if I
wanted to rejoin the student

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:37.270
search service, which to me was
proof that I wasn't actively

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:40.570
signed up, even though I
continued to receive emails. And

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:43.660
I ended up actually receiving
emails for nearly a year after

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:47.590
